The '''Random Century Cake Bundle''' is a {{Legendary}} item.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Random Century Cake Bundle''' can be obtained from [[Raffle of the Century]] event.

==Usage== 
The player could right-click a '''Random Century Cake Bundle''' to grant themselves {{Pink|5}} random [[Century Cake]]s.

